# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files (abapGit + tooling expect LF)
#
# The framework's own src/ is pulled into SAP systems by abapGit, which expects
# LF, and CONVENTIONS §6 asks for this file in every repository that carries
# ABAP or generated trees. This one carries both and had none - the only
# .gitattributes here was build/.gitattributes, which says the OPPOSITE (`*
# -text`) for a deliberate reason: those trees are shipped byte for byte and
# git must not touch them. That rule still applies; a .gitattributes deeper in
# the tree wins over this one.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.abap text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
